# Goal: Build Multi-Step Registration Module (Frontend & Backend)

This plan outlines the architecture for the production-ready Multi-Step Registration Module for AgriChain, supporting both Farmers and Buyers with MetaMask integration, JWT authentication, and MongoDB storage.

